# Ordinary stock campaign acceptance — 4 October 2026

This record uses the current default campaign, seed 8, 3,200 pesos, Retiro alone
and no recruited personnel. The created officer has a legal 550-point profile.
Every hire, arrival, cache transfer, reload, treatment, journey and battle uses
ordinary orders. Money, health, ammunition, personnel, ownership, random state
and successful outcomes are not assigned during the route.

The September fresh-route records retain their original source and figures.
Current created/hired long-route fixtures declare a separate 32,000-peso funded
package. Those scenarios do not establish ordinary 3,200-peso acceptance.

The earned checkpoints through Mendoza preparation used the gameplay source based on `0a7bece9`
(`01fdda9ce685` with the working stock test-suite description). Later gameplay
fixes need an integrated fresh run; these saved receipts do not establish a
whole campaign on an untested later source. The scoped Mendoza battle uses the
integrated `ad4098fd` source, computed identity `af1729372736`; that identity is
not a claim that the working stock candidate has received a new production build.

